  "details": "I noticed sometimes the listing shows the wrong thumbnail. Specifically in the \"purhcase options\"\n\nOpen my Holiday Haruki avatar listing, go to \"purchase options\" and you will see an OLD WIP thumbnail that I overwrote by uploading the thumbnail to the website. Thinking the thumbnail in game has priority, I tried to reupload the thumbnail in game, but it just says \"Error, photo already uploaded\" \n\nP.S. I see no \"build #\" under \"Settings>Debug>Build\" in game\n\nThat note might require further instructions.",
